Subject: [PATCH] defconfig: add overrides to resolve build error

Disable CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_BTF and do other necessary overrides
to make final defconfig generation succcesfull.

Change-Id: I9e61a0f10b299033d56ab145cfc7c9c8266e56d1
